{"ref":"BDB, שָׁחֹר","hw":"שָׁחֹר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁחֹר</span></big>  <strong>adj. black</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> of hair <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.31\">Lv 13:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.37\">37</a> (P), so fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁחֹרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.11\">Ct 5:11</a>; of skin, fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁחוֹרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.5\">1:5</a>; of horses, mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁחֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.2\">Zc 6:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.6\">6</a>.","next":"BDB, שַׁחֲרוּת","prev":"BDB, שְׁחוֹר²"}